  "name": "luh-a-novel-way-to-reduce-the-critical-deformation-for-cold-roll-bonding",
  "notes": "This set provides supplementary data for the following paper:\r\nBarienti, K.; Werwein, S.; Herbst, S.; Maier, H.J.; Nürnberger, F. A Novel Way to Reduce the Critical Deformation for Cold Roll Bonding. _Manufacturing Letters_ **2023**, _36_, 9–12, doi:[10.1016/j.mfglet.2022.12.006](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mfglet.2022.12.006).\r\n\r\nThe dataset includes:\r\n- the raw data for the $$O_2$$ concentration while filling the glovebox (./O2_glovebox)\r\n- .csv files of the image correlation for particle size measurements (./particle_size)\r\n- the qualitative bonding information used for sigmoid fitting (./recuction_bonded)\r\n\r\n\r\nAcknowledgements This research was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation)—Project-ID 394563137—SFB 1368.\r\n\r\n---\r\nkeywords: [Cold Roll Bonding, Rolling, Copper, Aluminum, XHV, Silane]\r\ncreated: 2023-01-20\r\nauthors: [Barienti, K.; Werwein, S.; Herbst, S.; Maier, H.J.; Nürnberger, F.]\r\nrelated_doi: 10.1016/j.mfglet.2022.12.006\r\nAcknowledgement: DFG Project-ID 394563137—SFB 1368.\r\n---\r\n",
